  unitName: Bewitching Wings Lunaris
  unitId: 60317
  unitNumber: 1781
  description: Althought Lunaris is supposed to have perished amidst the battles
    that the Twelve Guardians of the Gods waged against one another, no one was ever
    able to confirm her death. How different would her life have been had she run
    from it all with Alyut? Perhaps they would have made it to Elgaia together, becoming
    a part of its inhabitants. There they could have lived their lives to the fullest
    in honor of their fallen comrades, alongside the hope that would be born between
    the two...
  summonDesc: I have made it to the future<br>I may be filled with regrets and<br>resolutions,
    but I shall walk alongisde<br>you.
  fusionDesc: What I lacked wasn't power.<br>I know that now.
  evoDesc: I learned that hope can only exist after<br>overcoming despair. In this
    form, now I<br>can go anywhere I please.
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
